This WorkBuddy expert packages the teachable-figures skill from
https://github.com/ywEdAi/teachable-figures

- Code (skill scripts, HTML/CSS/JS of example lessons): MIT (see skills/teachable-figures/LICENSE)
- Written lesson content and skill guidance: CC BY 4.0 (see skills/teachable-figures/LICENSE-CONTENT).
  Suggested credit: "Teachable Figures" by ywEdAi
  (https://github.com/ywEdAi/teachable-figures), licensed under CC BY 4.0.
- Bundled upstream assets/anatomy and assets/iso-figure: MIT (their LICENSE files)
- Human Reference Atlas (HuBMAP) meshes are NOT included in this package.
